{
  "id": "837",
  "title": "Go Downstairs",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-03-08",
  "synopsis": "Ben is talking to teacher Zhang, but some words come out inappropriately…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/837/459b7e7273bf44265bf1a842b64cfe6a7eac76ad.mp3?1582298584",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们一起下楼吧\n\n本：张老师，这里有很多水。请小心裸体，我们一起下流吧！\n张老师：本！你是想说“请小心楼梯，我们一起下楼吧”，对吗？\n本：是的，老师！\n张老师：“裸体”、“楼梯”，“下流”、“下楼”。读音不对，意思就不一样了。你再说一遍“楼梯”、“下楼”。\n本：楼梯、下楼。\n张老师：这就对了。我们说话不用太快，读音对是最重要的。\n本：好的，张老师！请小心楼梯，我们一起下楼吧！",
    "traditional": "我們一起下樓吧\n\n本：張老師，這裡有很多水。請小心裸體，我們一起下流吧！\n張老師：本！你是想說“請小心樓梯，我們一起下樓吧”，對嗎？\n本：是的，老師！\n張老師：“裸體”、“樓梯”，“下流”、“下樓”。讀音不對，意思就不一樣了。你再說一遍“樓梯”、“下樓”。\n本：樓梯、下樓。\n張老師：這就對了。我們說話不用太快，讀音對是最重要的。\n本：好的，張老師！請小心樓梯，我們一起下樓吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Let’s go downstairs together"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：张老师，这里有很多水。请小心裸体，我们一起下流吧！",
      "traditional": "本：張老師，這裡有很多水。請小心裸體，我們一起下流吧！",
      "pinyin": "běn zhāng lǎo shī zhè lǐ yǒu hěn duō shuǐ qǐng xiǎo xīn luǒ tǐ wǒ men yì qǐ xià liú ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Teacher Zhang, there is a lot of water here. Please be careful with nudity, let’s get vulgar together!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "张老师：本！你是想说“请小心楼梯，我们一起下楼吧”，对吗？",
      "traditional": "張老師：本！你是想說“請小心樓梯，我們一起下樓吧”，對嗎？",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī běn nǐ shì xiǎng shuō qǐng xiǎo xīn lóu tī wǒ men yì qǐ xià lóu ba duì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Ben! You wanted to say “Please be careful on the stairs, let’s go downstairs together”, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：是的，老师！",
      "traditional": "本：是的，老師！",
      "pinyin": "běn shì de lǎo shī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Yes, that’s right, teacher!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "张老师：“裸体”、“楼梯”，“下流”、“下楼”。",
      "traditional": "張老師：“裸體”、“樓梯”，“下流”、“下樓”。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī luǒ tǐ lóu tī xià liú xià lóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "读音不对，意思就不一样了。你再说一遍“楼梯”、“下楼”。",
      "traditional": "讀音不對，意思就不一樣了。你再說一遍“樓梯”、“下樓”。",
      "pinyin": "dú yīn bú duì yì si jiù bù yí yàng le nǐ zài shuō yí biàn lóu tī xià lóu",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: “Nudity” and “stairs”, “vulgar” and “downstairs”."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pronounced incorrectly, the meaning isn’t the same. You say ”stairs″ and ”downstairs″ one more time."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "本：楼梯、下楼。",
      "traditional": "本：樓梯、下樓。",
      "pinyin": "běn lóu tī xià lóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Stairs, downstairs."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "张老师：这就对了。我们说话不用太快，读音对是最重要的。",
      "traditional": "張老師：這就對了。我們說話不用太快，讀音對是最重要的。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī zhè jiù duì le wǒ men shuō huà bú yòng tài kuài dú yīn duì shì zuì zhòng yào de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: This was correct. We don’t need to talk that fast, the correct pronunciation is what’s most important."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "本：好的，张老师！请小心楼梯，我们一起下楼吧！",
      "traditional": "本：好的，張老師！請小心樓梯，我們一起下樓吧！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de zhāng lǎo shī qǐng xiǎo xīn lóu tī wǒ men yì qǐ xià lóu ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, teacher Zhang! Please be careful on the stairs, let’s go downstairs together!"
    }
  ],
